      "html": "<p>Tridensimilis brevis is a cute, free-swimming dwarf glass cat that attains a maximum length of 3 cm. It belongs to the notorious candiru relationship, but is no blood sucker at all. This tiny catfish is so translucent that it is possible to observe the way of the food from the mouth to the vent.</p>"
