      "html": "<p>The fish was received from Peru.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/10c-catfishes-remaining-catfish-from-south-america/tridensimilis_brevis_en/",
      "html": "<p>T. brevis can be kept problem free with small tetras, but one should better keep no Corydoras, especially C. pygmaeus, along with Tridensimilis.</p>"
